{"connection_id": "BC-c63e09e83562da1d61d5", "ref": "WLC:Ps.103.22", "target": "sec14", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "All creation praises its ruler", "note": "The closing call to all God's works to bless him matches the commentary's universal Lordship and praise before any specific benefit is named."}
