{"connection_id": "BC-2bd46466e0145879fa85", "ref": "WLC:Ps.107.7", "target": "sec14", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "led by a straight way to a city to dwell in", "note": "YHWH leads the lost travellers on a straight way to habitation, combining guidance, road, and house in the commentary's exact sequence."}
